    {"topic":"<one
    allowed value or ''none''>","events":["<allowed values>"],"trust":<int -3..3>,"affection":<int
    -3..3>,"suspicion":<int -3..3>}

    Default deltas to 0; move by 1 only when
    clearly warranted.'
